This repository documents the setup of a Cybersecurity Virtual Lab Environment created for the Cybersecurity Internship (Batch B083A).
The lab provides a safe, isolated environment for practicing:
Penetration testing
Vulnerability assessment
Network scanning
Malware analysis
Mobile security testing
CTF challenges
The environment is built using Oracle VirtualBox with multiple operating systems configured on a shared 10.0.0.0/24 NATNetwork.
